        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 1977049248}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
      setEmotes:
        emotions:
        - player: 0
          character: {fileID: 2053004077}
          emotes: 0
          duration: 0
      questions:
        fromDatabase: 0
        questions:
          questions: []
        cycle: 1
        isOneTime: 0
        DeductTime: 0
      eventType: 2
      interval: 0
    - dialogue:
        dialogueLines:
        - characterObj: {fileID: 2053004077}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 0}
          dialogueType: 0
          line: Magandang araw, Bayani! Ngayon ay sisimulan natin ang unang bahagi
            ng iyong paglalakbay sa Noli Me Tangere. Tatalakayin natin ang mahahalagang
            pangyayari mula Kabanata 1 hanggang 5
      setLocation:
        setLocatoins: []
      setEmotes:
        emotions: []
      questions:
        fromDatabase: 0
        questions:
          questions: []
        cycle: 1
        isOneTime: 0
        DeductTime: 0
      eventType: 0
      interval: 0
    - dialogue:
        dialogueLines:
        - characterObj: {fileID: 2053004077}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 0}
          dialogueType: 0
          line: Good day, class!
        - characterObj: {fileID: 2053004077}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 0}
          dialogueType: 0
          line: "Today, we are going to talk about a very interesting and important
            topic \u2014 the thematic analysis of Chapters 1 to 5 of Noli Me Tangere.
            This lesson is important because it helps us understand not only the
            story, but also the social issues and historical realities that Rizal
            wanted to expose during his time"
      setLocation:
        setLocatoins:
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 29729221}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 600127057}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 1977049248}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 1977049248}
          direction: 2
          walk: 0
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
      setEmotes:
        emotions: []
      questions:
        fromDatabase: 0
        questions:
          questions: []
        cycle: 1
        isOneTime: 0
        DeductTime: 0
      eventType: 1
      interval: 1
    - dialogue:
        dialogueLines:
        - characterObj: {fileID: 2053004077}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 7096670327494543431, guid: 1189e97e912249f40a9ba9cf596f1aea, type: 3}
          dialogueType: 0
          line: "Ngayon, Bayani, haharapin mo ang panibagong yugto ng kamalayan.
            Dito mo makikilala sina Elias at Pilosopo Tasyo \u2014 mga tinig ng katotohanan
            na madalas balewalain. Matututuhan mong hindi lahat ng matalino ay nauunawaan,
            at hindi lahat ng boses ay pinakikinggan."
      setLocation:
        setLocatoins:
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 29729221}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 600127057}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 1977049248}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
      setEmotes:
        emotions: []
      questions:
        fromDatabase: 0
        questions:
          questions: []
        cycle: 1
        isOneTime: 0
        DeductTime: 0
      eventType: 0
      interval: 0
    - dialogue:
        dialogueLines:
        - characterObj: {fileID: 2053004077}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 4146786208365501868, guid: 3963256cc1b186c41a9d912c94fcd164, type: 3}
          dialogueType: 1
          line: Makikita natin dito ang tema ng kapangyarihan at status sa lipunan.
            Si Kapitan Tiyago ay gumagamit ng kayamanan at koneksyon sa simbahan
            upang tumaas ang kanyang katayuan
        - characterObj: {fileID: 2053004077}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 1335385452945238478, guid: ffcea649099c2b945a8914d4efeb7128, type: 3}
          dialogueType: 1
          line: Dito lumilitaw ang tema ng pag-ibig at alaala. Ipinapakita ang damdamin
            ni Ibarra at ang kanyang pagkakaugnay sa nakaraan at kabutihan ng pamilya.
        - characterObj: {fileID: 2053004077}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 4633355498211079068, guid: f6717a2679d1bce4db62770a6cc869dc, type: 3}
          dialogueType: 1
          line: Ang larawang ito ay sumisimbolo sa kawalang-katarungan at pagdurusa.
